      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'CRIEFF PTE. LTD. would like to obtain consent for the collection and use
    of personal information for advertising and marketing purposes in order to provide
    better services to its members.


    - Related Acts and subordinate statutes:
    Personal Information Protection Act, Credit Information Act, Electronic Financial
    Transactions Act, Electronic Commerce Act, Electronic Signature Act, Information
    and Communication Network Act, etc

    - Purpose of processing: Advertising,
    promotion, and promotion of product services of defenGO and its affiliates

    -
    Processing item: Name, mobile phone number, email address, terminal identification
    number (terminal ID)

    - Information reception channel: email, SMS, app PUSH,
    Kakao Talk message

    - Period of retention and use of personal information:
    from the time of consent to the collection and use of personal information for
    advertising marketing purposes to the time of withdrawal of consent or withdrawal
    of membership


    [Information on refusal to consent] Consent to receive advertising
    and marketing is optional, and even if you refuse to consent, there is no impact
    on the use of the Steika Wallet service. In addition, you can withdraw your consent
    to receive advertising and marketing at any time from the [Settings > Marketing
    Agree] menu.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 03da826af0d7bb148afc26be23d2246d, type: 2}
